# Play test of Radio Tower Remade (CIPlay radio_tower_remade, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the
# dock (1.45 m) below the tower on the south terrace (2.7 m), its decks at 9, 16 and 23 m, the radio room on the top
# deck's north half, the old shark cage on the seabed south-west.
island Radio Tower Remade
expect step 0
expect title Back on the Air

# From the dock up the beach to the tower's foot: the keeper's note
walk 0 -35 to 0 -27 to 0 -24 h=2.6
zone landing
expect step 1
read Keeper's note
expect step 2

# The battery bank, from the cage locker in the old shark cage
open Cage locker
expect story battery 1
expect step 3

# Old Beak on the roof
zone roof
expect message doesn't share
expect step 4
kill Screecher
expect step 5

# Up the tower's three ladders, across the top deck into the radio room
climb 0.5 -22.6 h=2.7
climb -2.5 -22.6 h=9
climb 0.5 -22.6 h=16
expect stand -1 -20 h=23.06
walk 0.5 -20 to 0.5 -15 to 0.5 -10.5 h=23.1
zone radioroom
expect step 6

# The radio on the air: the locker opens
use radio
expect message talks again
expect shown onairlights
expect story battery 0
open Radio room locker
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_Reciever 1
expect done
